Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Old 4:3 and 16:9 modes (640x480 ... 1920x1080) become virtual modes up to
; the screen size, instead of the Mac display's native modes only (issue #58).
; Prefix-wide: Wine builds the mode list in whichever of its processes
; refreshes the displays (explorer.exe), so an AppDefaults key has no effect.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Wine\X11 Driver]
"EmulateModeset"="Y"
